Package: farsight-server
Version: __VERSION__
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: __ARCH__
Depends: curl, ca-certificates, gnupg, iproute2, systemd
Maintainer: Farsight <massimo.bernava@gmail.com>
Description: Farsight control plane, telemetry broker and dashboards
 Installs and manages Mosquitto (MQTT broker), Telegraf (MQTT->InfluxDB
 bridge), InfluxDB 2.x, Grafana, and the farsight-server control plane
 dashboard. All services are bound to the Tailscale interface only. See
 PROJECT_SPEC.md in the farsight repository for the full design.
